Vendored third-party code
-------------------------
snakehaitch/workflow/scripts/ contains FEDI helper scripts taken from HAITCH:

    FEDI_shm.py                    FEDI_shore.py
    _fedi_applytransform.sh        _fedi_create_grad5cls_index.py
    _fedi_dwiregistration.sh       _fedi_outlierdetection.py
    _fedi_rotate_bvecs_ants.py     _fedi_segm_outliers.py
    _fedi_shorerecon.py

  Source : https://github.com/IntelligentImaging/HAITCH  (GPL-3.0)
  Author : Haykel Snoussi, PhD -- IMAGINE Group, Computational Radiology
           Laboratory, Boston Children's Hospital / Harvard Medical School

All are byte-identical to upstream except _fedi_outlierdetection.py, which
carries a 12-line additive patch marked "HAITCH-SNAKEBIDS PATCH" (an optional
--grad argument). See CHANGES.md section 5.

